    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This memo describes the extensions to the Resource Reservation
Protocol - Traffic Engineering (RSVP-TE) signaling protocol to
support Label Switched Paths (LSPs) in a GMPLS-controlled network
that includes devices using the flexible optical grid.</t>
    </abstract>
